  "original": {
    "html": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n\n<head>\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n    <title>立夏时节 | 回望北京的春天</title>\n</head>\n\n<body>\n    <section\n        style=\"padding: 0; margin: 0; font-family: 'PingFang SC', 'Hiragino Sans GB', 'Microsoft YaHei', sans-serif; background: linear-gradient(to bottom, #121212, #1a1a1a); color: #e0e0e0; line-height: 1.6; max-width: 100%; overflow-x: hidden;\">\n\n        <!-- 封面区域 -->\n        <section\n            style=\"height: 100vh; display: flex; flex-direction: column; justify-content: center; background: linear-gradient(135deg, #2c1e21 0%, #1d2433 100%); padding: 32px; box-sizing: border-box;\">\n            <section style=\"margin-bottom: 32px;\">\n                <h1\n                    style=\"font-size: 35.2px; font-weight: 900; margin: 0; letter-spacing: -0.5px; line-height: 1.2; color: #f0f0f0;\">\n                    立夏时节</h1>\n                <h2 style=\"font-size: 28.8px; font-weight: 700; margin: 8px 0 0; color: #d0d0d0; line-height: 1.3;\">\n                    用66张图带你回望<br>北京的春天</h2>\n            </section>\n\n            <section style=\"margin: 24px 0;\">\n                <svg width=\"100%\" height=\"80\" viewBox=\"0 0 300 80\">\n                    <path d=\"M10,40 Q150,10 290,40\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#d88c9a\" stroke-width=\"2\">\n                        <animate attributeName=\"d\" from=\"M10,40 Q150,10 290,40\" to=\"M10,40 Q150,70 290,40\" dur=\"3s\"\n                            repeatCount=\"indefinite\" />\n                    </path>\n                    <circle cx=\"150\" cy=\"40\" r=\"5\" fill=\"#d88c9a\">\n                        <animate attributeName=\"cy\" from=\"25\" to=\"55\" dur=\"3s\" repeatCount=\"indefinite\" />\n                    </circle>\n                </svg>\n            </section>\n\n            <section style=\"font-size: 16px; color: #a0a0a0; letter-spacing: 1px; font-weight: 300;\">\n                SPRING IN BEIJING · 2025\n            </section>\n        </section>\n\n        <!-- 引言部分 -->\n        <section\n            style=\"padding: 40px 24px; background-color: #202020; box-shadow: 0 5px 15px rgba(0,0,0,0.2); border-radius: 20px; margin: -16px 16px 24px; position: relative; z-index: 10;\">\n            <h3\n                style=\"font-size: 24px; font-weight: 700; color: #e0e0e0; margin: 0 0 16px; border-left: 4px solid #d88c9a; padding-left: 12.8px;\">\n                引言：立夏与春天的告别</h3>\n\n            <p\n                style=\"font-size: 16.8px; line-height: 1.8; color: #c0c0c0; margin: 0 0 16px; text-align: justify; text-indent: 2em;\">\n                立夏已至，春意渐远。在这个充满希望的季节里，我们用66张照片记录下北京春天的每一个美好瞬间。从早春的萌动到暮春的温柔，每一帧都是这座城市对春天的深情告白。</p>\n        </section>\n\n        <!-- 早春的萌动 -->\n        <section\n            style=\"margin: 0 16px 32px; background-color: #252525; border-radius: 16px; overflow: hidden; box-shadow: 0 8px 20px rgba(0,0,0,0.3);\">\n            <section style=\"background-color: #1e2530; padding: 28.8px; border-radius: 16px 16px 0 0;\">\n                <h3\n                    style=\"font-size: 25.6px; font-weight: 800; margin: 0; color: #e0e0e0; display: flex; align-items: center;\">\n                    <span\n                        style=\"display: inline-block; width: 30px; height: 30px; border-radius: 50%; background-color: #d88c9a; margin-right: 12.8px; flex-shrink: 0; color: white; font-size: 16px; text-align: center; line-height: 30px;\">1</span>\n                    早春的萌动\n                </h3>\n                <p style=\"font-size: 16px; color: #a0a0a0; margin: 8px 0 0 41.6px; font-style: italic;\">The First Touch\n                    of Spring</p>\n            </section>\n\n            <section style=\"padding: 24px; background: #202020;\">\n                <section style=\"margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n                    <h4\n                        style=\"font-size: 19.2px; font-weight: 700; color: #d0d0d0; margin: 0 0 16px; border-bottom: 1px dashed #444; padding-bottom: 8px;\">\n                        二月春风似剪刀：北京的第一抹绿意</h4>\n                    <p style=\"font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.7; margin: 0 0 16px; text-indent: 2em; color: #b0b0b0;\">\n                        颐和园的冰雪初融，玉渊潭的早樱悄然绽放。胡同里的初绿与风筝，勾勒出早春的生机。</p>\n\n                    <section\n                        style=\"margin: 24px 0; border-radius: 12px; overflow: hidden; box-shadow: 0 5px 15px rgba(0,0,0,0.2);\">\n                        <img src=\"https://picsum.photos/600/350?random=1\" alt=\"北京早春风光\"\n                            style=\"width: 100%; height: auto; display: block; border-radius: 12px;\">\n                        <section\n                            style=\"padding: 12.8px; background: #181818; font-size: 13.6px; color: #a0a0a0; text-align: center;\">\n                            颐和园·昆明湖冰雪初融（2月中旬）</section>\n                    </section>\n                </section>\n\n                <section>\n                    <h4\n                        style=\"font-size: 19.2px; font-weight: 700; color: #d0d0d0; margin: 24px 0 16px; border-bottom: 1px dashed #444; padding-bottom: 8px;\">\n                        樱花与红墙：古都的浪漫碰撞</h4>\n                    <p style=\"font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.7; margin: 0 0 16px; text-indent: 2em; color: #b0b0b0;\">\n                        故宫的海棠与红墙相映成趣，元都遗址的\"海棠花溪\"如诗如画。</p>\n                </section>\n            </section>\n        </section>\n\n        <!-- 盛春的绚烂 -->\n        <section\n            style=\"margin: 0 16px 32px; background-color: #252525; border-radius: 16px; overflow: hidden; box-shadow: 0 8px 20px rgba(0,0,0,0.3);\">\n            <section style=\"background-color: #2a2022; padding: 28.8px; border-radius: 16px 16px 0 0;\">\n                <h3\n                    style=\"font-size: 25.6px; font-weight: 800; margin: 0; color: #e0e0e0; display: flex; align-items: center;\">\n                    <span\n                        style=\"display: inline-block; width: 30px; height: 30px; border-radius: 50%; background-color: #d88c9a; margin-right: 12.8px; flex-shrink: 0; color: white; font-size: 16px; text-align: center; line-height: 30px;\">2</span>\n                    盛春的绚烂\n                </h3>\n                <p style=\"font-size: 16px; color: #a0a0a0; margin: 8px 0 0 41.6px; font-style: italic;\">The Blooming\n                    Season</p>\n            </section>\n\n            <section style=\"padding: 24px; background: #202020;\">\n                <section style=\"margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n                    <h4\n                        style=\"font-size: 19.2px; font-weight: 700; color: #d0d0d0; margin: 0 0 16px; border-bottom: 1px dashed #444; padding-bottom: 8px;\">\n                        满城尽带花海棠：京城的春日高潮</h4>\n\n                    <section style=\"display: flex; margin: 24px 0; gap: 10px;\">\n                        <section\n                            style=\"flex: 1; border-radius: 12px; overflow: hidden; box-shadow: 0 3px 10px rgba(0,0,0,0.2);\">\n                            <img src=\"https://picsum.photos/300/400?random=2\" alt=\"胡同紫藤\"\n                                style=\"width: 100%; height: auto; display: block; border-radius: 12px 12px 0 0;\">\n                            <section\n                                style=\"padding: 8px; font-size: 12px; color: #a0a0a0; text-align: center; background: #181818;\">\n                                胡同紫藤花</section>\n                        </section>\n                        <section\n                            style=\"flex: 1; border-radius: 12px; overflow: hidden; box-shadow: 0 3px 10px rgba(0,0,0,0.2);\">\n                            <img src=\"https://picsum.photos/300/400?random=3\" alt=\"春日花海\"\n                                style=\"width: 100%; height: auto; display: block; border-radius: 12px 12px 0 0;\">\n                            <section\n                                style=\"padding: 8px; font-size: 12px; color: #a0a0a0; text-align: center; background: #181818;\">\n                                春花盛开</section>\n                        </section>\n                    </section>\n\n                    <p style=\"font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.7; margin: 16px 0; text-indent: 2em; color: #b0b0b0;\">\n                        胡同四合院的紫藤爬满老墙，老北京人的春日活动尽显烟火气。</p>\n                </section>\n\n                <section>\n                    <h4\n                        style=\"font-size: 19.2px; font-weight: 700; color: #d0d0d0; margin: 24px 0 16px; border-bottom: 1px dashed #444; padding-bottom: 8px;\">\n                        市井与繁花：烟火气里的春天</h4>\n                    <p style=\"font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.7; margin: 0 0 16px; text-indent: 2em; color: #b0b0b0;\">\n                        遛鸟、品茶，市井生活与繁花交织，构成独特的春日画卷。</p>\n                </section>\n            </section>\n        </section>\n\n        <!-- 暮春的余韵 -->\n        <section\n            style=\"margin: 0 16px 32px; background-color: #252525; border-radius: 16px; overflow: hidden; box-shadow: 0 8px 20px rgba(0,0,0,0.3);\">\n            <section style=\"background-color: #1e2530; padding: 28.8px; border-radius: 16px 16px 0 0;\">\n                <h3\n                    style=\"font-size: 25.6px; font-weight: 800; margin: 0; color: #e0e0e0; display: flex; align-items: center;\">\n                    <span\n                        style=\"display: inline-block; width: 30px; height: 30px; border-radius: 50%; background-color: #7b98b2; margin-right: 12.8px; flex-shrink: 0; color: white; font-size: 16px; text-align: center; line-height: 30px;\">3</span>\n                    暮春的余韵\n                </h3>\n                <p style=\"font-size: 16px; color: #a0a0a0; margin: 8px 0 0 41.6px; font-style: italic;\">The Last Whisper\n                    of Spring</p>\n            </section>\n\n            <section style=\"padding: 24px; background: #202020;\">\n                <h4\n                    style=\"font-size: 19.2px; font-weight: 700; color: #d0d0d0; margin: 0 0 16px; border-bottom: 1px dashed #444; padding-bottom: 8px;\">\n                    柳絮与晚霞：春天最后的温柔</h4>\n\n                <p style=\"font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.7; margin: 0 0 16px; text-indent: 2em; color: #b0b0b0;\">\n                    奥森公园的落英缤纷，胡同里的柳絮纷飞。立夏前的雷雨与晚霞，为春天画上浪漫句点。</p>\n\n                <section\n                    style=\"margin: 24px 0; border-radius: 12px; overflow: hidden; box-shadow: 0 5px 15px rgba(0,0,0,0.2);\">\n                    <img src=\"https://picsum.photos/600/350?random=4\" alt=\"北京暮春景色\"\n                        style=\"width: 100%; height: auto; display: block; border-radius: 12px;\">\n                    <section\n                        style=\"padding: 12.8px; background: #181818; font-size: 13.6px; color: #a0a0a0; text-align: center;\">\n                        立夏前的北京晚霞（4月下旬）</section>\n                </section>\n            </section>\n        </section>\n\n        <!-- 结语部分 -->\n        <section\n            style=\"padding: 32px 24px 48px; margin: 0 16px 32px; background: linear-gradient(135deg, #1d2433 0%, #2c1e21 100%); border-radius: 16px; box-shadow: 0 5px 15px rgba(0,0,0,0.2);\">\n            <h3 style=\"font-size: 22.4px; font-weight: 700; color: #e0e0e0; margin: 0 0 24px; text-align: center;\">\n                结语：从春天到夏天的期待</h3>\n\n            <p\n                style=\"font-size: 16.8px; line-height: 1.8; color: #c0c0c0; margin: 0 0 24px; text-align: justify; text-indent: 2em;\">\n                66张照片，记录下北京春天短暂而珍贵的美丽。期待夏日的绿荫荷风，继续书写这座城市的四季故事。</p>\n\n            <section style=\"display: flex; justify-content: center; margin-top: 32px;\">\n                <section style=\"display: inline-flex; gap: 12.8px;\">\n                    <span\n                        style=\"background: #d88c9a; color: white; padding: 8px 16px; border-radius: 20px; font-size: 14.4px; font-weight: 500;\">#北京春天记忆</span>\n                    <span\n                        style=\"background: #7b98b2; color: white; padding: 8px 16px; border-radius: 20px; font-size: 14.4px; font-weight: 500;\">#立夏时节</span>\n                    <span\n                        style=\"background: #444; color: white; padding: 8px 16px; border-radius: 20px; font-size: 14.4px; font-weight: 500;\">#城市影像</span>\n                </section>\n            </section>\n\n            <section style=\"margin-top: 32px; text-align: center;\">\n                <svg width=\"120\" height=\"30\" viewBox=\"0 0 120 30\">\n                    <path d=\"M10,15 L110,15\" stroke=\"#888\" stroke-width=\"1\" stroke-dasharray=\"1,3\" />\n                    <text x=\"60\" y=\"25\" font-family=\"'PingFang SC'\" font-size=\"8\" fill=\"#888\" text-anchor=\"middle\">END\n                        OF SPRING</text>\n                </svg>\n            </section>\n        </section>\n    </section>\n</body>\n\n</html>"
  },
  "html": "<section style=\"padding: 24px; color: #292b2e; background-color: #fff\"><h1 style=\"font-size: 35.2px; font-weight: 900; margin: 0; letter-spacing: -0.5px; line-height: 1.2; color: #f0f0f0\">把生活里的小事，慢慢做好</h1><section><p style=\"font-size: 16.8px; line-height: 1.8; color: #c0c0c0; margin: 0 0 16px; text-align: justify; text-indent: 2em\">生活里有许多值得记录的瞬间。早上推开窗，阳光落在桌面上，新的一天从一杯温水开始。</p><h2 style=\"font-size: 28.8px; font-weight: 700; margin: 8px 0 0; color: #d0d0d0; line-height: 1.3\">留一点时间给自己</h2><p style=\"font-size: 16.8px; line-height: 1.8; color: #c0c0c0; margin: 0 0 16px; text-align: justify; text-indent: 2em\">每天给自己留出一小段安静的时间，读几页书，或者去楼下走一走。<strong>从一件具体的小事开始</strong>，让改变自然发生。</p><blockquote><p style=\"font-size: 16.8px; line-height: 1.8; color: #c0c0c0; margin: 0 0 16px; text-align: justify; text-indent: 2em\">认真对待每一个平常的日子。</p></blockquote><h2 style=\"font-size: 28.8px; font-weight: 700; margin: 8px 0 0; color: #d0d0d0; line-height: 1.3\">让行动变得简单</h2><ul><li>选一件今天可以完成的事</li><li>留意自己的真实感受</li><li>给下一次尝试留出余地</li></ul><table><thead><tr><th>时段</th><th>安排</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>早晨</td><td>散步和阅读</td></tr><tr><td>傍晚</td><td>回顾一天</td></tr></tbody></table><p style=\"font-size: 16.8px; line-height: 1.8; color: #c0c0c0; margin: 0 0 16px; text-align: justify; text-indent: 2em\">生活不会因为一次决定立刻改变，但持续的行动会慢慢留下痕迹。</p></section></section>",
